---
title: Bridge
description: Short bridge statement between problem and offer.
---
<section class="bg-gray-50 px-6 py-16 dark:bg-gray-900">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl border-y border-gray-300 py-12 text-center dark:border-gray-700">
		<h2 class="font-display text-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl">
			{@richtext statement ?? 'A short bridge statement between problem and offer.'}
		</h2>

		<p class="text-secondary mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7">
			{@richtext note ?? 'A supporting note that follows the statement.'}
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
